        out.putString("stream","PASS: proactive refresh before expiry, pending request coalescing/no cancellation, 9/16/25/45-second trusted cached immediate save and original time/accuracy, unknown31/expired61 rejection, nearby coarse estimate protection, newer motion invalidates cache and older callbacks never revive it, distant/recovery callbacks, ready/updating/unavailable/recovered card states, immediate retry on record tap; first home tab/order, compact detail, denied permission/no save, stale callback rejection, original click/time-offset, wait/timeout/retry/late-scene confirmation, idempotence, meter-reference located path; layout 320/375/414/768. Synthetic test workspace="+workspace+"\n");passed=true;
